      "description": "Storage bands ENROLLED (have dry_run) but producing NO util_ratio — the local-path MetricUnrepresentable case: breathe can't compute a per-volume util from a whole-node-fs metric. On rio this is nats-jetstream (enrolled, no util series). Expected >0 while storage carving is parked on local-path; the Carving row below explains why."
