        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**WARNING — on local-path these read the WHOLE NODE FS, not the\nvolume.** Every PVC below reports the *same* capacity/used numbers\n(the node disk), because local-path has no per-volume accounting.\nThe honest per-DB size is in the **Postgres row below**\n(`cnpg_pg_database_size_bytes`). This is the breathe\n**MetricUnrepresentable** finding: when `used > capacity` for a PVC,\nor when every PVC shows an identical capacity, that *proves* the\nmetric isn’t per-volume.\n"
